Prayagi ji, aapka idea ek normal dialer se kaafi aage hai. Aap ek AI-powered Smart Dialer banana chahte hain, jo default phone app ki tarah kaam kare, automatic call recording, real-time spam protection, caller announcement, Google Drive backup aur privacy ko ek hi application mein jode.

Is project mein sabse mahatvapurn baat hai: incoming call screen turant dikhni chahiye, phone ring hone mein deri nahi honi chahiye aur background mein battery consumption minimum rehna chahiye.

Ek technical baat pehle spasht kar doon: Android par app apne liye RAM ka ek fixed hissa reserve karke 24/7 guarantee nahi kar sakta. Android memory ko manage karta hai aur zaroorat padne par processes ko band bhi kar sakta hai. Lekin sahi default dialer role, system call-screening APIs, lightweight services aur efficient architecture se response ko kaafi reliable banaya ja sakta hai.

Isi tarah, automatic call recording ki availability Android version, device manufacturer, regional restrictions aur default dialer implementation par nirbhar karegi. AI prompt mein in limitations ko bypass karne ke bajay supported implementation aur clear status reporting anivarya honi chahiye.

